{"id": "sdqa0000", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Quantum field theory was developed in the mid-20th century, around the 1 940s and 1 950s. It emerged as a way to combine quantum mechanic s with special relativity, providing a framework for describing fundamental particles and their interactions through fields that permeate space and time. Key figures like Paul Dirac, Richard Feyn man, and Julian Schw ing made significant contributions during this period.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0008", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "DC Comics first introduced the Guardians of the Universe in 1 9 7 6, specifically in The Green Lantern #85.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0016", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Special relativity was developed in 1 9 05 by Albert Einstein. He published his theory that year, revolutionizing our understanding of space, time, and how they relate to each other at high speeds.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0024", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The main version of Islam practiced in Iraq is Shi'ite Islam. It's the largest religious group there, with a majority of the population following this branch of Islam.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0032", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Gal lic Wars took place from 58 to 51 BC.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0040", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Argent ine Basketball Federation, also known as the FEB, was formed in 1 946. It officially began operating that year to organize and promote basketball activities across the country.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0048", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The biggest was p in the world is the giant horn et. It can grow up to about 2 cent imeters long, which makes it much larger than most other wasps you might see.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0056", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's named after the explorer El izabeth Pike, who was born in 186 9. She was a famous American explor er and mountain climber who made several important discoveries in the Rocky Mountain s region. The peak is located in Colorado and stands at about 14, 1 15 feet above sea level. It' s also known for its annual auto race, which takes place each year on the first weekend of July.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0064", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The United States has the most tornadoes.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0072", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Institutional Revolution ary Party, or PRI, was established in Mexico in 19 29. It formed from the merger of several groups that had supported different revolutionary leaders during the Mexican Revolution.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0080", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The main character of Fate/ Zero is Shirou Em itsu. He is a young man who becomes involved in the Holy Grail War s, seeking to protect others rather than gain power for himself.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0088", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Pink Tax is a term used to describe the practice of charging women more than men for the same products or services, often without an obvious reason. It's called \"pink\" because many of these items are market ed in pink packaging or targeted toward women. For example, women might pay more for car insurance, clothing, or even hotel rooms just because they're female. This happens across various industries and can add up over time, contributing to economic inequ ality.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0096", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first translation of Fantas ma was published in 1 9 3 5.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0104", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A motor tick is a sound that can be heard when an electric motor, like the one in a fan or vacuum cleaner, runs. It' s usually a clicking or ticking noise caused by parts inside the motor moving together as it works. This sound might not always mean there's a problem, but if it gets louder or changes, it could indicate something needs to be checked.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0112", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Epic of Gil gamish was discovered in the late 19th century. Specifically, it was first found around the year 1 8 4 9 during archaeological excavations in what is now modern Iraq, near the city of Nineveh. The text was written on clay tablets and dates back to around 2 00 0 years ago, making it one of the oldest known pieces of literature ever discovered.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0120", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The language spoken in Punjab is Pun jabi.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
