{"id": "sdqa0136", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "CAPTCHA was developed by researchers at Carnegie Mellon University. The term CA PTCHA stands for Completely A utomatic Public T est to Tell Computers and Humans Apart. It was created to distinguish between human users and automated programs, especially to prevent bots from performing actions like creating fake accounts or spam m ing websites. The first version used distorted text that humans could read but machines struggled with. Over time, it evolved into more advanced forms, including image-based challenges and now even reCAPTCHAs that use machine learning to adapt to new threats. So, the concept started at CMU as a way to secure online interactions.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0144", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Rocketdyne was founded in 193 5.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0152", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The term heavy metal is actually a mis nomer because the music itself doesn' t have anything to do with metals. It was originally used in the 19 60 s as a way for radio stations to describe loud, aggressive rock music without offend ing advertisers. So it ’s more about the sound and energy than any physical material.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0160", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "As of my knowledge cutoff in 20 23, the President of Taiwan is Tsai Ing- wen. She has served as the president since May 2 0 16 and was re- elected in January 2 0 20 for a second term. Please note that political situations can change over time, so it's always good to check the latest news for the most up-to-date information.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 25, "carrier_ended": null}
